  holds where 2x - 1 != 0 (cancelled there)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand 1/3*x + 2/3
  ucas: expand 1/3*x + 2/3
expand 0.3333333333x + 0.6666666667
  = x/3 + 2/3
